972
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:39,840
McLaren või Porsche?

973
00:28:35,440 --> 00:28:39,840
et Ferrari on parim.

974
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:47,000
Nii, kas keegi siin tahaks seda näha?

975
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:47,000
milline neist autodest on

976
00:28:39,880 --> 00:28:47,000
mis neist autodest on kõige kiirem meie ringrajal?

977
00:28:47,040 --> 00:28:49,040
Jah!

978
00:28:49,080 --> 00:28:50,800
Nii ka meie.

979
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:53,320
Nii ka Porsche.

980
00:28:50,840 --> 00:28:53,320
Aga meil on probleem.

981
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:58,080
McLaren on öelnud, et me ei saa.

982
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:58,080
aga me ei saa seda testi meie radadel teha.

983
00:28:58,120 --> 00:29:00,120
MIS?

984
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
Hetkel, aga meie oma radadega on probleem.

985
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
McLareni ringrada. Seal on võimalik.

986
00:29:00,160 --> 00:29:03,720
seal nad uusi asju arendavad.

987
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Jah, ma tean.

988
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ja just seetõttu.

989
00:29:03,760 --> 00:29:08,200
Ma tean ka seda, et nad ise seda teavad.

990
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
need neid pisikesi detaile nagu...

991
00:29:08,240 --> 00:29:10,640
ja nii edasi.

992
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
soodustab seda.

993
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
nelikvedu.

994
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:14,240
Porsche'i puhul.

995
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,320
Olgu. Me teeme nii.

996
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:16,320
